  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "054132d5e2612599",
      "translationZh": "这里有一些数据，展示了工具对 Qwen 3.8 27b 专业领域智能水平的价值。我使用 Qwen 的工作主要涉及房地产、私募股权以及相关金融事务。这不是典型的编程领域，所以这些结果可能并不适用于所有人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73d02d1c0a0c6fea",
      "translationZh": "我在一张 5090 上运行 Qwen 3.8 27b nvp4「RadixArk kVarN」。使用的是 vLLM 0.27.1，并对 TurboQuant 和调度器做了几处修复，避免它动不动就卡死：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bb90f3bf4a80110",
      "translationZh": "我的使用场景既要支持后台进程，也要支持与人的实时交互，因此我在规模和速度之间做了一些取舍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddadd08ecae5fa57",
      "translationZh": "最大输入：180,224 个 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "886dd8b971bafd0f",
      "translationZh": "2 个并发的「medium」推理级别智能体请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfa0122d5fee3678",
      "translationZh": "人为设置 8,192 个 token 的上限，以制止失控的思考",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08df438a73684145",
      "translationZh": "每个并发智能体的生成速度约为 108 tok/s（两个合计约 200）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94d96d9a49e5d267",
      "translationZh": "模型平均首个 token 延迟（TTFT）约为 1.28 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "302a55478552559e",
      "translationZh": "我直接使用开箱即用的模型，在一套根据专业资格认证考试编制的自定义测试集上进行了测试，共 600 道题。这些测试涵盖承保、估值、信贷、REIT 会计、1031 置换税法等冷门专业内容，还包括一组需要模型排查并解决问题的虚构商业场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2200c8c72c951197",
      "translationZh": "在没有任何辅助、也没有互联网连接的情况下，Qwen 在这些测试中取得了 95.25% 的综合得分，已经相当不错。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afbc5c64f335cf35",
      "translationZh": "随后，我接入了一个工具/MCP 层，提供一些基本功能，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19e66f091a4e53af",
      "translationZh": "确定性财务计算器（免费）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e595466ec3b7fc3",
      "translationZh": "网络研究，按排名选用服务提供商，并限制 API 支出（上限为 10）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ed6231dc3a83044",
      "translationZh": "基本日期和时间功能（免费）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f8864e45c1925a7",
      "translationZh": "在使用同一模型、相同测试输入的情况下，工具将综合得分提升至 98.05%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fe4df9f4cc3bafd",
      "translationZh": "然后，我明确向它提示了一组与专业工作相关的搜索工具。例如，何时应该搜索 SEC Edgar，而不是直接问 Google。提示这些信息来源后，综合得分进一步小幅提高至 98.44%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bb6713a9c027b48",
      "translationZh": "评估指标 未使用工具 已启用工具 搜索提示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "387f7613021a8ae8",
      "translationZh": "核心专业定量分析（100 个案例）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1ecfddd16bdbe57",
      "translationZh": "初级分析师专业定量分析（100 个案例）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8301beeab7e6a115",
      "translationZh": "合成案例研究（100 个案例）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf7b42171ad526ca",
      "translationZh": "基础难度的知识、伦理与升级处理（100 个案例）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c52262b15bc8346e",
      "translationZh": "中等难度的知识、伦理与升级处理（100 个案例）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b72fa838c4c9831",
      "translationZh": "高难度的知识、伦理与升级处理（100 个案例）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a517ceaa5ab3e7fe",
      "translationZh": "至少对我来说，结论是：Qwen 开箱即用的表现已经很扎实，而工具和引导式搜索的支持让它变得非常能干。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "088b62fb20029284",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/offgridai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
